n Studio, the company later operated under the names Walt Disney Studio and Walt Disney Productions before adopting its current name in 1986. Disney established itself as a leader in animation with the release of Steamboat Willie in 1928. The short film's pioneering use of synchronized sound helped popularize Mickey Mouse, who became the company's mascot and corporate icon.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Walt_Disney_Company"},"ru":{"t":"The Walt Disney Company","x":"The Walt Disney Company — транснациональная медиакорпорация. Штаб-квартира располагается в комплексе Walt Disney Studios в городе Бербанк.","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Walt_Disney_Company"}},"wiki_at":"2026-11-19T16:10:43.774076+00:00"}